<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="74c66373">The document describes how each benefit will be measured and the process by which data will be collated from different
parts of the organization or systems to support program benefits reporting. It should outline the measures, used, the
frequency of data collection, process for validating the data, roles and responsibility and the structure and content of
the benefits reports.</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="c45e8710"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="507121db">&lt;p&gt;
    As content is compiled it should be reviewed with both data owners and program stakeholders.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="da3bcd0f"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="6016b247">&lt;p&gt;
    To document the approach by which each of the program benefits will be measured and how this data will be used to form
    reports for key program stakeholders. This builds on initial measures that will have been documented within the
    Benefits Measures Register but will focus more on the process by which measurement data will be collated, validated,
    and published.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    For large scale change programs, benefits measurement can be quite complex and require data to be collated from
    multiple sources, reports and systems which may cover different countries, time frames and standards. Capturing and
    documenting this detail within a specific output helps confirm that the low-level detail supporting this process is
    considered and that clear ownership for different parts of the process can be clarified and planned for.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="impactOfNotHaving" nodeId="59d36005"></attribute>
<attribute name="reasonsForNotNeeding" nodeId="322e194f"></attribute>
<attribute name="briefOutline" nodeId="66eb823f">Typical section headings of a Benefits Reporting Approach would include:&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Benefits, relevant measures, and data sources
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Key reporting stakeholders
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Benefits reports structure
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Benefits reporting frequency and timeline
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Roles and responsibilities
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="representationOptions" nodeId="4b65bcc8"></attribute>
<attribute name="representation" nodeId="775cecd"></attribute>
<attribute name="notation" nodeId="b9f396c7"></attribute>
</Element>
